  "content_id": "16135974",
  "title": "How To Contact A Live Agent Via Edge Support",
  "description": "Edge Wallet offers real‑time, human support via multiple convenient channels. Choose the method that works best for you:\n1. Help Center &a...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">Edge Wallet offers real‑time, human support via multiple convenient channels. Choose the method that works best for you:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>1. Help Center &amp; Live Chat</b></p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Live Chat:</b> Click the <b>chat bubble</b> in the bottom right corner to connect instantly with our team!</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>2. Email</b></p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">support@edge.app</a></b><br>Feel free to send us a detailed message, and we’ll get back to you promptly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>3. Phone</b></p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>+1 (619) 777‑5688</b><br>If we miss your call, please leave a detailed voicemail and we’ll return your call as soon as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>4. Secure Signal Support</b></p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>@edge.14</b><br>For private, encrypted assistance, reach out via Signal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">We’re here to help—don’t hesitate to contact us through whichever channel you prefer!</p>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
  "state": "published",
